#: ../../library/dht.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`dht` --- DHT11 and DHT22 temperature/humidity sensors"
msgstr ":mod:`dht` --- sensor suhu/kelembaban DHT11 dan DHT22"

#: ../../library/dht.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :mod:`dht` module provides drivers for the DHT11 and DHT22 (also known "
"as AM2302) low-cost temperature and humidity sensors."
msgstr ""
"Modul :mod:`dht` menyediakan driver untuk sensor suhu dan kelembaban "
"berbiaya rendah DHT11 dan DHT22 (juga dikenal sebagai AM2302)."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:10
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Contoh::"

#: ../../library/dht.rst:20
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Kelas"

#: ../../library/dht.rst:24
msgid ""
"Base class for DHT sensors. Not normally instantiated directly --- use "
":class:`DHT11` or :class:`DHT22` instead."
msgstr ""
"Kelas dasar untuk sensor DHT. Biasanya tidak diinstansiasi langsung --- "
"gunakan :class:`DHT11` atau :class:`DHT22` sebagai gantinya."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:29
msgid ""
"Trigger a measurement on the sensor and read the 5-byte response into the "
"internal buffer. Raises :exc:`Exception` with the message ``\"checksum "
"error\"`` if the data checksum is invalid."
msgstr ""
"Memicu pengukuran pada sensor dan membaca respons 5-byte ke dalam buffer "
"internal. Memunculkan :exc:`Exception` dengan pesan ``\"checksum error\"`` "
"jika checksum data tidak valid."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:33
msgid ""
"Call this method before reading :meth:`temperature` or :meth:`humidity`. The"
" DHT sensors require at least 1 second (DHT11) or 2 seconds (DHT22) between "
"consecutive measurements."
msgstr ""
"Panggil metode ini sebelum membaca :meth:`temperature` atau "
":meth:`humidity`\\ . Sensor DHT memerlukan setidaknya 1 detik (DHT11) atau 2"
" detik (DHT22) antara pengukuran berturut-turut."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:39
msgid ""
"Driver for the DHT11 sensor. Connect the sensor's data line to *pin* (a "
":py:class:`machine.Pin`). The DHT11 reports integer values with 1 percent "
"relative humidity and 1 degree Celsius resolution."
msgstr ""
"Driver untuk sensor DHT11. Sambungkan jalur data sensor ke *pin* (sebuah "
":py:class:`machine.Pin`\\ ). DHT11 melaporkan nilai integer dengan resolusi "
"1 persen kelembaban relatif dan 1 derajat Celsius."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:45
msgid ""
"Return the relative humidity from the most recent :meth:`measure` call, as "
"an integer percentage (0--100)."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan kelembaban relatif dari pemanggilan :meth:`measure` terbaru, "
"sebagai persentase integer (0--100)."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:50
msgid ""
"Return the temperature from the most recent :meth:`measure` call, as an "
"integer in degrees Celsius."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan suhu dari pemanggilan :meth:`measure` terbaru, sebagai integer"
" dalam derajat Celsius."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:55
msgid ""
"Driver for the DHT22 / AM2302 sensor. Connect the sensor's data line to "
"*pin* (a :py:class:`machine.Pin`). The DHT22 reports values with 0.1 percent"
" relative humidity and 0.1 degree Celsius resolution, and supports negative "
"temperatures."
msgstr ""
"Driver untuk sensor DHT22 / AM2302. Sambungkan jalur data sensor ke *pin* "
"(sebuah :py:class:`machine.Pin`\\ ). DHT22 melaporkan nilai dengan resolusi "
"0,1 persen kelembaban relatif dan 0,1 derajat Celsius, serta mendukung suhu "
"negatif."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:62
msgid ""
"Return the relative humidity from the most recent :meth:`measure` call, as a"
" ``float`` percentage (0.0--100.0)."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan kelembaban relatif dari pemanggilan :meth:`measure` terbaru, "
"sebagai persentase ``float`` (0.0--100.0)."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:67
msgid ""
"Return the temperature from the most recent :meth:`measure` call, as a "
"``float`` in degrees Celsius. Negative values are supported."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan suhu dari pemanggilan :meth:`measure` terbaru, sebagai "
"``float`` dalam derajat Celsius. Nilai negatif didukung."
